# chooses no target ("up to one") and still gains 1 life (CR 119.3), the Lotus staying. On turn 2 Bot2 plays its own Black
# Lotus and uses it, and on turn 3 the attack trigger takes the card of Bot2's graveyard (any graveyard, not only the
# opponent's or only one's own) and gains another life: Bot1 is at 22 and Bot2, who took three, at 17.

